# Love in Every Language

A simple romantic web animation where “I love you” in different languages smoothly comes together to form a heart.

The project is built entirely in a single `index.html` file and can be deployed directly with GitHub Pages.

## Features

- Animated heart made from love phrases
- Multiple languages
- Bangla included
- Smooth text positioning animation
- Romantic pink, rose, lavender, and champagne color palette
- Soft glowing background
- Responsive design
- No external libraries
- No frameworks
- Single-file project

